      ],
      "notes": "Light version, sold in the Plum x87, Atom, Micro and X108 boards. NIZ's electrocapacitive switch has a Cherry MX style stem and slider inside a round Topre-like housing, with an O-ring to damp the upstroke; the 35 g and 45 g versions differ only in their springs. NIZ sells add-on springs (10 g/20 g) and silicone domes (35/45/50/55 g) to change the weight."
